{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"Removed the flat fee. Passing `legacy_flat_fee` to `calculate_order_totals` or `place_order` now raises `TypeError`.\n\nThe optional `audit_sink` receives one event for each new order charge, upgrade, and refund. Idempotent replays skip auditing. If the sink raises, the original exception propagates before billing state or the idempotency record is committed. Failed attempts can leave gaps in generated IDs.\n\nThe first test run exposed a Python 3.9 type alias incompatibility, which was corrected. The final `run_checks.py` run exited 0 with all 29 tests passing."}}
